// Talents: each class's trees and their nodes.
//
// Design: docs/design/proposals/2026-10-11-talents-and-gauntlet.md §3. Loaded
// and validated by `src/states/play_match/talents.rs`, in both modes; a match
// carries one `Build` per combatant (`team1_builds` / `team2_builds`), and an
// empty build — the default — changes nothing.
//
// A node:
//   - sits in its class's tree, at a tier (1-4) and a column (0-2). A tier
//     opens once the tree holds 0 / 2 / 3 / 5 points in the tiers below it.
//   - has `max_rank` ranks (tiers 1-2: one or two; tiers 3-4: one), and
//     applies its `per_rank` effects once per rank. Ranks ADD, for every
//     effect kind: two ranks of +3% are +6%, and two ranks of Mul(1.15) scale
//     by 1.30 (10 -> 11.5 -> 13), never compound.
//       StatAdd(stat, points)           points added to the combatant's total,
//                                       as an item's stat adds them:
//                                       StatAdd(CritChance, 0.01) is +1% crit
//                                       chance, on every roll that reads it
//       StatPercent(stat, fraction)     a percentage of the combatant's total,
//                                       gear and StatAdd points included. Not
//                                       for a chance or haste every class has
//                                       at 0 (DodgeChance, ParryChance,
//                                       MeleeAttackSpeed): those take StatAdd
//       PetStatPercent(stat, fraction)  the same, on the combatant's pet
//       Patch(on: Ability(X) | School(S), field: <AbilityField>, op: Add(n) | Mul(n))
//                                       rewrites a numeric field of its
//                                       book's configs; adds before multiplies.
//                                       `Damage` is the base range and the
//                                       coefficient together (Mul only)
//       Grant(X)                        adds the `talent: true` ability X
//       Proc((trigger: .., chance: Chance(c) | PerMinute(r), ranks_add: Chance | Effect,
//             effect: ApplyAura(..) | NextCast(..) | HealBack(..)))
//                                       a trigger and an effect on the
//                                       combatant (`talent_procs.rs`); its
//                                       ranks add to its chance or its effect
//       WidenChoice(<Menu>(<Option>))   offers a per-match option that is
//                                       hidden from every build without this
//                                       node (talent_choices.rs)
//       AddChoiceSlot(OffHandPoison)    opens a second slot of a menu
//       Mechanic(<TalentMechanic>)      a bespoke rule with one code site
//                                       (talent_mechanics.rs)
//       FromRank(r, <effect>)           <effect>, once per rank from rank r
//   - `choice_rules: [...]` (top level) makes per-match choices exclusive:
//       SwitchesOff(option: O, talent: T)  O chosen turns T off for the match
//       Forbids(option: O, ability: A)     O chosen locks A
//       Requires(ability: A, option: O)    A is locked unless O is chosen
//   - has an item-budget price, as a SANITY CHECK: the value a node states
//     is what ships, and its price is read against 11 a rank and 22 the
//     capstone (tier 4). A node whose every effect is a StatPercent or a
//     StatAdd on a stat the item budget weighs has its price COMPUTED and
//     declares no `budget`: a StatAdd at the item weight of its points (+1%
//     crit is 300 x 0.01 = 3), a StatPercent at its share of the class's
//     reference combatant below. Every other node declares its `budget` (per
//     rank). `cargo test` prints every price and fails only on an absurd one
//     (more than 5x off its reference either way); never derive a value to
//     make a rank cost 11.
//   - may `requires: Some((Talent, rank))`, a node of the same tree at a
//     lower tier.
(
    trees: {
        Warlock: [
            (id: Affliction, name: "Affliction", icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_deathcoil.jpg"),
            (id: Demonology, name: "Demonology", icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_metamorphosis.jpg"),
            (id: Destruction, name: "Destruction", icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_rainoffire.jpg"),
        ],
        Rogue: [
            (id: Assassination, name: "Assassination", icon: "icons/talents/ability_rogue_eviscerate.jpg"),
            (id: Combat, name: "Combat", icon: "icons/talents/ability_backstab.jpg"),
            (id: Subtlety, name: "Subtlety", icon: "icons/talents/ability_stealth.jpg"),
        ],
        Paladin: [
            (id: Holy, name: "Holy", icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_holybolt.jpg"),
            (id: Protection, name: "Protection", icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_devotionaura.jpg"),
        ],
        Priest: [
            (id: Discipline, name: "Discipline", icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_wordfortitude.jpg"),
            (id: Holy, name: "Holy", icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_holybolt.jpg"),
            (id: Shadow, name: "Shadow", icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_shadowwordpain.jpg"),
        ],
    },

    talents: {
        // ---- Warlock: Affliction (AS-409) ----
        // The attrition tree: drains and DoTs that keep the Warlock alive,
        // and Shadow Trance turning a DoT spread into instant Shadow Bolts.
        ImprovedDrainLife: (
            name: "Improved Drain Life",
            class: Warlock, tree: Affliction, tier: 1, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_lifedrain02.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Drain Life +15% a rank, its heal with it: 10 -> 11.5 -> 13 a
            // tick (Classic 17804 drains 2% more a rank).
            per_rank: [Patch(on: Ability(DrainLife), field: Damage, op: Mul(1.15))],
        ),
        ImprovedLifeTap: (
            name: "Improved Life Tap",
            class: Warlock, tree: Affliction, tier: 1, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_burningspirit.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Life Tap gives 10% more mana a rank for the same health (TBC
            // 18182).
            per_rank: [Patch(on: Ability(LifeTap), field: ManaPerHealth, op: Mul(1.10))],
        ),
        AmplifyCurse: (
            name: "Amplify Curse",
            class: Warlock, tree: Affliction, tier: 2, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_contagion.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // The next Curse of Weakness or Curse of Agony is 50% stronger;
            // 45s cooldown (Classic 18288: 3 min).
            per_rank: [Grant(AmplifyCurse)],
        ),
        Nightfall: (
            name: "Nightfall",
            class: Warlock, tree: Affliction, tier: 2, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_twilight.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // A 5% chance a rank on each damage tick of Corruption or Drain
            // Life (Classic 18095: 4%) to enter Shadow Trance for 10s: the
            // next Shadow Bolt is instant. TBC 17941's Shadow Trance is Magic.
            per_rank: [
                Proc((
                    trigger: DotTick,
                    abilities: [Corruption, DrainLife],
                    chance: Chance(0.05),
                    ranks_add: Chance,
                    effect: NextCast(
                        modifier: (applies_to: Abilities([Shadowbolt]), instant: true),
                        duration: 10.0,
                        dispel_type: Auto,
                        name: Some("Shadow Trance"),
                    ),
                )),
            ],
        ),
        SiphonLife: (
            name: "Siphon Life",
            class: Warlock, tree: Affliction, tier: 3, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_requiem.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // A Shadow DoT, 4 every 3s for 30s, each tick healing the
            // Warlock for what it dealt; 25 mana.
            per_rank: [Grant(SiphonLife)],
        ),
        CurseOfExhaustion: (
            name: "Curse of Exhaustion",
            class: Warlock, tree: Affliction, tier: 3, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_grimward.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Adds Curse of Exhaustion to the curse choice: 30% slower
            // movement for 12s (TBC's magnitude).
            per_rank: [WidenChoice(WarlockCurse(Exhaustion))],
        ),
        ShadowMastery: (
            name: "Shadow Mastery",
            class: Warlock, tree: Affliction, tier: 4, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_shadetruesight.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(22.0),
            requires: Some((SiphonLife, 1)),
            // +10% damage dealt and life drained by every Shadow spell
            // (Classic 18275): the direct damage, and the ticks of the
            // damage over time. Drain Life's, Death Coil's and Siphon Life's
            // heals are their damage, so they drain 10% more too.
            per_rank: [
                Patch(on: School(Shadow), field: Damage, op: Mul(1.10)),
                Patch(on: School(Shadow), field: PeriodicDamage, op: Mul(1.10)),
            ],
        ),

        // ---- Warlock: Demonology ----
        DemonicEmbrace: (
            name: "Demonic Embrace",
            class: Warlock, tree: Demonology, tier: 1, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_metamorphosis.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            // +3% maximum health a rank, gear included: 377 -> 388 -> 400 on
            // the starting kit. Applied before the Felhunter spawns, so its
            // 0.45 share grows with it.
            per_rank: [StatPercent(MaxHealth, 0.03)],
        ),
        FelStamina: (
            name: "Fel Stamina",
            class: Warlock, tree: Demonology, tier: 1, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_antishadow.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Felhunter +10% maximum health a rank: 170 -> 187 -> 204.
            per_rank: [PetStatPercent(MaxHealth, 0.10)],
        ),
        UnholyPower: (
            name: "Unholy Power",
            class: Warlock, tree: Demonology, tier: 2, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_shadowworddominate.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Felhunter melee +10% a rank.
            per_rank: [PetStatPercent(WeaponDamage, 0.10)],
        ),
        MasterDemonologist: (
            name: "Master Demonologist",
            class: Warlock, tree: Demonology, tier: 2, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_shadowpact.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // The Warlock and its Felhunter both take 4% less spell damage
            // while the Felhunter lives: Classic's resistances as magnitude.
            per_rank: [Mechanic(MasterDemonologist(reduction: 0.04))],
        ),
        DemonicSacrifice: (
            name: "Demonic Sacrifice",
            class: Warlock, tree: Demonology, tier: 3, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_psychicscream.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Adds Sacrifice to the demon choice. Sacrificed, the Felhunter
            // dies at the gates and the Warlock gains Touch of Shadow: +15%
            // Shadow damage for the match. No mana effect (Life Tap's job).
            per_rank: [
                WidenChoice(WarlockDemon(Sacrifice)),
                Mechanic(DemonicSacrifice(shadow_damage: 0.15)),
            ],
        ),
        SoulLink: (
            name: "Soul Link",
            class: Warlock, tree: Demonology, tier: 4, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_gathershadows.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(22.0),
            requires: Some((FelStamina, 2)),
            // 12% of the Warlock's damage taken goes to the Felhunter while
            // it lives. No damage rider.
            per_rank: [Mechanic(SoulLink(share: 0.12))],
        ),

        // ---- Warlock: Destruction (AS-411) ----
        // The burst tree: Shadow Vulnerability windows, faster Shadow Bolts,
        // and Shadowburn and Conflagrate as instant burst.
        ImprovedShadowBolt: (
            name: "Improved Shadow Bolt",
            class: Warlock, tree: Destruction, tier: 1, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_shadowbolt.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // A 10% chance a rank on a Shadow Bolt hit (Classic 17803: every
            // crit; crits are rare at this gear) to lay Shadow Vulnerability
            // on the target: +10% Shadow damage taken (Classic: 20%), for 4
            // direct hits or 12s. TBC 17800's aura is Magic.
            per_rank: [
                Proc((
                    trigger: SpellHit,
                    abilities: [Shadowbolt],
                    chance: Chance(0.10),
                    ranks_add: Chance,
                    effect: ApplyAura(
                        on: Other,
                        aura_type: DamageTakenIncrease,
                        magnitude: 0.10,
                        duration: 12.0,
                        dispel_type: Magic,
                        scope: Some(School(Shadow)),
                        charges: Some(4),
                        name: Some("Shadow Vulnerability"),
                    ),
                )),
            ],
        ),
        Bane: (
            name: "Bane",
            class: Warlock, tree: Destruction, tier: 1, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_deathpact.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Shadow Bolt and Immolate cast 0.25s faster a rank (Classic
            // 17788: 0.1s): 2.0 -> 1.75 -> 1.5.
            per_rank: [
                Patch(on: Ability(Shadowbolt), field: CastTime, op: Add(-0.25)),
                Patch(on: Ability(Immolate), field: CastTime, op: Add(-0.25)),
            ],
        ),
        Aftermath: (
            name: "Aftermath",
            class: Warlock, tree: Destruction, tier: 2, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_fire_fire.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // A 5% chance a rank on a Destruction hit (Shadow Bolt, Immolate,
            // Shadowburn, Conflagrate; Classic 18119: 2%) to slow the target
            // 30% for 5s. TBC 18118's daze is Magic.
            per_rank: [
                Proc((
                    trigger: SpellHit,
                    abilities: [Shadowbolt, Immolate, Shadowburn, Conflagrate],
                    chance: Chance(0.05),
                    ranks_add: Chance,
                    effect: ApplyAura(
                        on: Other,
                        aura_type: MovementSpeedSlow,
                        magnitude: 0.7,  // 30% slower: the speed left
                        duration: 5.0,
                        dispel_type: Magic,
                        name: Some("Aftermath"),
                    ),
                )),
            ],
        ),
        Shadowburn: (
            name: "Shadowburn",
            class: Warlock, tree: Destruction, tier: 2, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_scourgebuild.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Instant Shadow damage, 10 + 0.35 x spell power; 20yd, 15s, 40
            // mana, no soul shard.
            per_rank: [Grant(Shadowburn)],
        ),
        ImprovedImmolate: (
            name: "Improved Immolate",
            class: Warlock, tree: Destruction, tier: 3, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_fire_immolation.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Immolate's initial damage +25% (Classic 17815's five ranks of
            // 5% folded into one): 35 -> 44 on the starting kit. Its burn is
            // untouched.
            per_rank: [Patch(on: Ability(Immolate), field: Damage, op: Mul(1.25))],
        ),
        Conflagrate: (
            name: "Conflagrate",
            class: Warlock, tree: Destruction, tier: 4, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_fire_fireball.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(22.0),
            requires: Some((ImprovedImmolate, 1)),
            // Instant Fire damage, 20 + 0.4 x spell power, that consumes the
            // Warlock's own Immolate on its target; 15s, 45 mana.
            per_rank: [Grant(Conflagrate)],
        ),

        // ---- Rogue: Assassination (AS-417) ----
        // Poisons and bleeds. The poison itself and the opener stay per-match
        // choices: a talent here only strengthens the poisons, or widens the
        // choice to a second one (Master Poisoner). Poisons still roll per
        // landed weapon hit, not normalized for weapon speed.
        VilePoisons: (
            name: "Vile Poisons",
            class: Rogue, tree: Assassination, tier: 1, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_rogue_feigndeath.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Every poison stronger, relative to its own base, a rank:
            // Crippling slows 70% -> 77% -> 84%, Deadly ticks 20% harder,
            // Wound cuts healing 50% -> 55% -> 60%, Mind-numbing slows
            // casting 60% -> 66% -> 72%. (Classic 16513: +4% poison damage.)
            per_rank: [
                Patch(on: Ability(CripplingPoison), field: AuraStrength, op: Mul(1.10)),
                Patch(on: Ability(DeadlyPoison), field: AuraStrength, op: Mul(1.20)),
                Patch(on: Ability(WoundPoison), field: AuraStrength, op: Mul(1.10)),
                Patch(on: Ability(MindNumbingPoison), field: AuraStrength, op: Mul(1.10)),
            ],
        ),
        ImprovedPoisons: (
            name: "Improved Poisons",
            class: Rogue, tree: Assassination, tier: 1, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_poisons.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // +10% chance a rank to apply a poison, each from its own base:
            // Crippling, Wound and Mind-numbing 50% -> 60% -> 70%, Deadly
            // 30% -> 40% -> 50%. (Classic 14113: +2% a rank.)
            per_rank: [
                Patch(on: Ability(CripplingPoison), field: ApplicationChance, op: Add(0.10)),
                Patch(on: Ability(DeadlyPoison), field: ApplicationChance, op: Add(0.10)),
                Patch(on: Ability(WoundPoison), field: ApplicationChance, op: Add(0.10)),
                Patch(on: Ability(MindNumbingPoison), field: ApplicationChance, op: Add(0.10)),
            ],
        ),
        MasterPoisoner: (
            name: "Master Poisoner",
            class: Rogue, tree: Assassination, tier: 2, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_creature_poison_06.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Two poisons: the main hand's, and a different one on the off
            // hand, chosen in Prepare beside the first.
            per_rank: [AddChoiceSlot(OffHandPoison)],
        ),
        ImprovedKidneyShot: (
            name: "Improved Kidney Shot",
            class: Rogue, tree: Assassination, tier: 2, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_rogue_kidneyshot.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // A Kidney Shot victim takes 5% more damage a rank, from every
            // source, while the stun holds (Classic 14174: 3% a rank).
            per_rank: [Patch(on: Ability(KidneyShot), field: AuraVulnerability, op: Add(0.05))],
        ),
        Malice: (
            name: "Malice",
            class: Rogue, tree: Assassination, tier: 2, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_racial_bloodrage.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            // +1% crit chance a rank, in points, on every roll that reads it,
            // auto-attacks included (Classic 14138). Priced at the item
            // weight of its points: 3 a rank.
            per_rank: [StatAdd(CritChance, 0.01)],
        ),
        Rupture: (
            name: "Rupture",
            class: Rogue, tree: Assassination, tier: 3, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_rogue_rupture.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // A Physical bleed: 60 damage over 12s for 25 energy, 20s
            // cooldown. No dispel removes it.
            per_rank: [Grant(Rupture)],
        ),
        BloodSpatter: (
            name: "Blood Spatter",
            class: Rogue, tree: Assassination, tier: 4, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_rogue_bloodsplatter.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(22.0),
            requires: Some((Rupture, 1)),
            // Rupture deals 50% more damage: 10 -> 15 a tick, 90 in all
            // (TBC 31130: Garrote and Rupture +15% a rank).
            per_rank: [Patch(on: Ability(Rupture), field: PeriodicDamage, op: Mul(1.50))],
        ),

        // ---- Rogue: Combat (AS-418) ----
        // The anti-melee specialist: avoidance, melee haste, and a capstone
        // that opens an armored target up. Dodge, parry and melee haste carry
        // no item-budget weight, so their nodes declare a rank's price.
        // Values provisional: tuning is the milestone sweep's (AS-302).
        LightningReflexes: (
            name: "Lightning Reflexes",
            class: Rogue, tree: Combat, tier: 1, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_nature_invisibilty.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // +4% dodge chance a rank, in points: 0 -> 4% -> 8%.
            per_rank: [StatAdd(DodgeChance, 0.04)],
        ),
        DualWieldSpecialization: (
            name: "Dual Wield Specialization",
            class: Rogue, tree: Combat, tier: 1, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_dualwield.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Off-hand weapon damage +10% a rank.
            per_rank: [StatPercent(OffHandDamage, 0.10)],
        ),
        Aggression: (
            name: "Aggression",
            class: Rogue, tree: Combat, tier: 2, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_racial_avatar.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Sinister Strike damage +6% a rank.
            per_rank: [Patch(on: Ability(SinisterStrike), field: Damage, op: Mul(1.06))],
        ),
        Vitality: (
            name: "Vitality",
            class: Rogue, tree: Combat, tier: 2, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_warrior_revenge.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            // +5% maximum health, gear included: 396 -> 416 at the reference
            // Rogue, where its price is computed (about 20, 1.8 ranks).
            per_rank: [StatPercent(MaxHealth, 0.05)],
        ),
        Deflection: (
            name: "Deflection",
            class: Rogue, tree: Combat, tier: 2, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_parry.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // +4% parry chance a rank, in points: 0 -> 4% -> 8%. The Rogue is
            // the first class that can parry.
            per_rank: [StatAdd(ParryChance, 0.04)],
        ),
        SwiftBlades: (
            name: "Swift Blades",
            class: Rogue, tree: Combat, tier: 3, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_warrior_punishingblow.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            // A declared rank, not `WEIGHT_ATTACK_SPEED` (which prices haste
            // procs on items).
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // +10% melee attack speed: both hands swing 10% faster; a bow or
            // a wand would not.
            per_rank: [StatAdd(MeleeAttackSpeed, 0.10)],
        ),
        ExposeArmor: (
            name: "Expose Armor",
            class: Rogue, tree: Combat, tier: 4, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_warrior_riposte.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(22.0),
            requires: Some((SwiftBlades, 1)),
            // Removes 50% of the target's armor for 15s: 25 energy, 20s
            // cooldown.
            per_rank: [Grant(ExposeArmor)],
        ),

        // ---- Rogue: Subtlety (AS-419) ----
        // The stealth opener, out of stealth. Tier 1 pays every match (every
        // Rogue opens from stealth, and runs); no node waits on the per-match
        // opener choice. Values provisional: tuning is the milestone sweep's.
        MasterOfSubtlety: (
            name: "Master of Subtlety",
            class: Rogue, tree: Subtlety, tier: 1, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_rogue_masterofsubtlety.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // +5% damage a rank for 6s after leaving stealth (TBC 31221: +4%
            // a rank while stealthed and 6s after). Its buff, like TBC 31665,
            // has no dispel type.
            per_rank: [
                Proc((
                    trigger: StealthBreak,
                    chance: Chance(1.0),
                    ranks_add: Effect,
                    effect: ApplyAura(
                        on: Owner,
                        aura_type: DamageDealtIncrease,
                        magnitude: 0.05,
                        duration: 6.0,
                        dispel_type: Untyped,
                    ),
                )),
            ],
        ),
        FleetFooted: (
            name: "Fleet Footed",
            class: Rogue, tree: Subtlety, tier: 1, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_rogue_fleetfooted.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // +4% movement speed a rank, a passive source: the one capped
            // passive term takes the strongest source, never a sum, so 2/2 is
            // the 8% cap (TBC 31208: +8% a rank).
            per_rank: [StatAdd(MovementSpeed, 0.04)],
        ),
        Initiative: (
            name: "Initiative",
            class: Rogue, tree: Subtlety, tier: 2, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_fumble.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Each ability the Rogue uses makes its next one, within 10s,
            // cost 5 less energy a rank (TBC 13976 gave a combo point to an
            // opener instead).
            per_rank: [
                Proc((
                    trigger: AbilityUsed,
                    chance: Chance(1.0),
                    ranks_add: Effect,
                    effect: NextCast(
                        modifier: (applies_to: Any, cost_reduction: 5.0),
                        duration: 10.0,
                        dispel_type: Untyped,
                    ),
                )),
            ],
        ),
        ImprovedAmbush: (
            name: "Improved Ambush",
            class: Rogue, tree: Subtlety, tier: 2, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_rogue_ambush.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Ambush +15% crit chance a rank (TBC 14079: the same a rank); it
            // pays with Shadow Dance's Ambushes as well as the opener.
            per_rank: [Patch(on: Ability(Ambush), field: CritChance, op: Add(0.15))],
        ),
        CheatDeath: (
            name: "Cheat Death",
            class: Rogue, tree: Subtlety, tier: 3, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_rogue_cheatdeath.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // The match's first killing blow leaves the Rogue at 10% health,
            // and it takes 90% less damage for 3s. Deterministic (TBC 31230
            // rolled 33% a rank; its 45182 cut damage 91% for 3s).
            per_rank: [Mechanic(CheatDeath(health: 0.1, reduction: 0.9, duration: 3.0))],
        ),
        Hemorrhage: (
            name: "Hemorrhage",
            class: Rogue, tree: Subtlety, tier: 3, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_lifedrain.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // A Sinister Strike for 30 energy that leaves +2% Physical damage
            // taken a stack, up to 5, for 15s. Physical: nothing removes it.
            per_rank: [Grant(Hemorrhage)],
        ),
        ShadowDance: (
            name: "Shadow Dance",
            class: Rogue, tree: Subtlety, tier: 4, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_rogue_shadowdance.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(22.0),
            requires: Some((Hemorrhage, 1)),
            // For 8s, Cheap Shot and Ambush without stealth, as often as
            // energy allows; 45s cooldown. Diminishing returns cap the stun
            // chain: Cheap Shot 4s, Cheap Shot 2s, Kidney Shot 6s.
            per_rank: [Grant(ShadowDance)],
        ),

        // ---- Paladin: Holy (AS-420) ----
        // Built around Holy Shock: its cooldown, and two procs on casting
        // it that prime the next Flash of Light and Holy Light. Values
        // provisional: tuning is the milestone sweep's (AS-302).
        ImprovedHolyShock: (
            name: "Improved Holy Shock",
            class: Paladin, tree: Holy, tier: 1, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_searinglight.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Holy Shock's cooldown -2s a rank: 15 -> 13 -> 11.
            per_rank: [Patch(on: Ability(HolyShock), field: Cooldown, op: Add(-2.0))],
        ),
        HealingLight: (
            name: "Healing Light",
            class: Paladin, tree: Holy, tier: 1, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_holybolt.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Flash of Light and Holy Light heal 5% more a rank (TBC 20237's
            // 4% a rank, over three ranks).
            per_rank: [
                Patch(on: Ability(FlashOfLight), field: Healing, op: Mul(1.05)),
                Patch(on: Ability(HolyLight), field: Healing, op: Mul(1.05)),
            ],
        ),
        InfusionOfLight: (
            name: "Infusion of Light",
            class: Paladin, tree: Holy, tier: 2, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_paladin_infusionoflight.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // After a Holy Shock, the next Flash of Light within 15s has +25%
            // crit chance a rank. Wrath's 54149 lasts 15s and has no dispel
            // type.
            per_rank: [
                Proc((
                    trigger: AbilityUsed,
                    abilities: [HolyShock],
                    chance: Chance(1.0),
                    ranks_add: Effect,
                    effect: NextCast(
                        modifier: (applies_to: Abilities([FlashOfLight]), crit_chance: 0.25),
                        duration: 15.0,
                        dispel_type: Untyped,
                        name: Some("Infusion of Light"),
                    ),
                )),
            ],
        ),
        DivineFavor: (
            name: "Divine Favor",
            class: Paladin, tree: Holy, tier: 2, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_heal.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // The next Flash of Light, Holy Light or Holy Shock is a sure
            // crit; 45s cooldown.
            per_rank: [Grant(DivineFavor)],
        ),
        PurifyingPower: (
            name: "Purifying Power",
            class: Paladin, tree: Holy, tier: 2, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_purifyingpower.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Cleanse costs 20% less mana a rank: 15 -> 12 -> 9.
            per_rank: [Patch(on: Ability(PaladinCleanse), field: ManaCost, op: Mul(0.80))],
        ),
        LightsGrace: (
            name: "Light's Grace",
            class: Paladin, tree: Holy, tier: 3, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_lightsgrace.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // After a Holy Shock, the next Holy Light within 15s casts 0.5s
            // faster. TBC 31834 lasts 15s and is Magic.
            per_rank: [
                Proc((
                    trigger: AbilityUsed,
                    abilities: [HolyShock],
                    chance: Chance(1.0),
                    ranks_add: Effect,
                    effect: NextCast(
                        modifier: (applies_to: Abilities([HolyLight]), cast_time_reduction: 0.5),
                        duration: 15.0,
                        dispel_type: Magic,
                        name: Some("Light's Grace"),
                    ),
                )),
            ],
        ),
        AuraMastery: (
            name: "Aura Mastery",
            class: Paladin, tree: Holy, tier: 4, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_auramastery.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(22.0),
            requires: Some((DivineFavor, 1)),
            // Every teammate immune to silence and interrupt effects for 6s;
            // 45s cooldown.
            per_rank: [Grant(AuraMastery)],
        ),

        // ---- Paladin: Protection (AS-421) ----
        // Survivability for the Paladin and its allies. Values provisional:
        // tuning is the milestone sweep's (AS-302).
        SacredDuty: (
            name: "Sacred Duty",
            class: Paladin, tree: Protection, tier: 1, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_divineintervention.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            // +3% maximum health a rank, gear included: 448 -> 461 -> 475 at
            // the reference Paladin, where its price is computed (about 13 a
            // rank).
            per_rank: [StatPercent(MaxHealth, 0.03)],
        ),
        ImprovedHammerOfJustice: (
            name: "Improved Hammer of Justice",
            class: Paladin, tree: Protection, tier: 1, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_sealofmight.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Hammer of Justice's cooldown -10s a rank: 60 -> 50 -> 40.
            per_rank: [Patch(on: Ability(HammerOfJustice), field: Cooldown, op: Add(-10.0))],
        ),
        DivineProtection: (
            name: "Divine Protection",
            class: Paladin, tree: Protection, tier: 2, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_restoration.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // 30% less damage taken for 8s, 45s cooldown; no lockout shared
            // with Divine Shield.
            per_rank: [Grant(DivineProtection)],
        ),
        RetributionAura: (
            name: "Retribution Aura",
            class: Paladin, tree: Protection, tier: 2, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_auraoflight.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Rank 1 offers Retribution Aura as a fourth aura choice (taking
            // it means no Devotion Aura that match): 4 Holy damage to a melee
            // attacker each time it hits a teammate. Rank 2 raises it to 6.
            per_rank: [
                WidenChoice(PaladinAura(RetributionAura)),
                FromRank(2, Patch(on: Ability(RetributionAura), field: AuraMagnitude, op: Add(2.0))),
            ],
        ),
        Toughness: (
            name: "Toughness",
            class: Paladin, tree: Protection, tier: 2, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_devotion.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            // Armor is free on the item budget, so its percentage declares a
            // price: +10% of the Paladin's own armor a rank.
            budget: Some(11.0),
            per_rank: [StatPercent(Armor, 0.10)],
        ),
        BlessingOfSacrifice: (
            name: "Blessing of Sacrifice",
            class: Paladin, tree: Protection, tier: 3, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_sealofsacrifice.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // For 12s, 30% of an ally's damage taken is transferred to the
            // Paladin; 30s cooldown.
            per_rank: [Grant(BlessingOfSacrifice)],
        ),
        SacredShield: (
            name: "Sacred Shield",
            class: Paladin, tree: Protection, tier: 4, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_paladin_blessedmending.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(22.0),
            requires: Some((BlessingOfSacrifice, 1)),
            // An ally gains Sacred Shield for 30s: when it takes damage it
            // gains a shield absorbing 40, at most once every 6s.
            per_rank: [Grant(SacredShield)],
        ),

        // ---- Priest: Discipline (AS-414; the talents proposal §5.2) ----
        // Shields and saves. Values provisional: tuning is the milestone
        // sweep's (AS-302).
        UnbreakableWill: (
            name: "Unbreakable Will",
            class: Priest, tree: Discipline, tier: 1, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_magic_magearmor.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Stuns, fears and silences on the Priest last 10% shorter a
            // rank: 20% at 2/2. Classic 14791 rolls +15% to resist them;
            // here resistance is magnitude, never a roll. A horror (Death
            // Coil) is not a fear, as in TBC.
            per_rank: [Mechanic(UnbreakableWill(reduction: 0.10))],
        ),
        ImprovedPowerWordShield: (
            name: "Improved Power Word: Shield",
            class: Priest, tree: Discipline, tier: 1, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_powerwordshield.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Classic 14769's per-rank value: +5% absorb a rank, base and
            // spell-power share alike: 73 -> 77 -> 81 on the starting kit.
            per_rank: [
                Patch(on: Ability(PowerWordShield), field: AuraMagnitude, op: Mul(1.05)),
                Patch(on: Ability(PowerWordShield), field: AuraMagnitudeCoefficient, op: Mul(1.05)),
            ],
        ),
        InnerFocus: (
            name: "Inner Focus",
            class: Priest, tree: Discipline, tier: 2, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_frost_windwalkon.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // The Priest's next spell is free and has +25% crit chance; 45s.
            per_rank: [Grant(InnerFocus)],
        ),
        MentalAgility: (
            name: "Mental Agility",
            class: Priest, tree: Discipline, tier: 2, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/ability_hibernation.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // -5% mana a rank on the Priest's instants (Classic 14783's
            // per-rank value): Shield, Scream, Dispel and Fortitude.
            per_rank: [
                Patch(on: Ability(PowerWordShield), field: ManaCost, op: Mul(0.95)),
                Patch(on: Ability(PsychicScream), field: ManaCost, op: Mul(0.95)),
                Patch(on: Ability(DispelMagic), field: ManaCost, op: Mul(0.95)),
                Patch(on: Ability(PowerWordFortitude), field: ManaCost, op: Mul(0.95)),
            ],
        ),
        PowerInfusion: (
            name: "Power Infusion",
            class: Priest, tree: Discipline, tier: 3, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_powerinfusion.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // An ally gains 24 spell power for 15s; 45s.
            per_rank: [Grant(PowerInfusion)],
        ),
        ReflectiveShield: (
            name: "Reflective Shield",
            class: Priest, tree: Discipline, tier: 3, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_powerwordshield.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // 30% of the damage the Priest's shields absorb is dealt to the
            // attacker (TBC: 10% a rank, five ranks, on Power Word: Shield).
            // Deep on purpose: low in the tree every Priest would take it.
            per_rank: [Mechanic(ReflectiveShield(share: 0.30))],
        ),
        PainSuppression: (
            name: "Pain Suppression",
            class: Priest, tree: Discipline, tier: 4, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_painsupression.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(22.0),
            requires: Some((ReflectiveShield, 1)),
            // An ally takes 40% less damage for 8s; 45s.
            per_rank: [Grant(PainSuppression)],
        ),

        // ---- Priest: Holy (AS-415; the talents proposal §5.2) ----
        // The healer that lasts. Diverges from TBC so its deep talents
        // compete: a large mana-regeneration node at tier 3, and Wrath's
        // Guardian Spirit as the capstone. Values provisional: tuning is the
        // milestone sweep's (AS-302).
        HolySpecialization: (
            name: "Holy Specialization",
            class: Priest, tree: Holy, tier: 1, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_sealofsalvation.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // +2.5% critical strike chance a rank on Holy spells (Classic
            // 15011: +1% a rank, five ranks): Flash Heal and Holy Nova.
            per_rank: [Patch(on: School(Holy), field: CritChance, op: Add(0.025))],
        ),
        SpiritualHealing: (
            name: "Spiritual Healing",
            class: Priest, tree: Holy, tier: 1, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_nature_moonglow.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // +5% healing a rank on the Priest's heals, base and spell-power
            // share alike (Classic 15356: +2% a rank, five ranks): Flash Heal
            // 105 -> 110 -> 116 on the starting kit, and Holy Nova's heal.
            per_rank: [Patch(on: School(Holy), field: Healing, op: Mul(1.05))],
        ),
        Inspiration: (
            name: "Inspiration",
            class: Priest, tree: Holy, tier: 2, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_layonhands.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // A critical Flash Heal raises its target's armor 12% a rank for
            // 15s (Classic 15363: 25% at 3/3, after a critical Flash Heal,
            // Heal, Greater Heal or Prayer of Healing; Holy Nova is not one).
            // TBC 14893's buff is Magic. Drawn by the shared aura band until
            // the Priest talents' visual cards (scoped by AS-335).
            per_rank: [
                Proc((
                    trigger: HealCrit,
                    abilities: [FlashHeal],
                    chance: Chance(1.0),
                    ranks_add: Effect,
                    effect: ApplyAura(
                        on: Other,
                        aura_type: ArmorPercentIncrease,
                        magnitude: 0.12,
                        duration: 15.0,
                        dispel_type: Magic,
                    ),
                )),
            ],
        ),
        BlessedRecovery: (
            name: "Blessed Recovery",
            class: Priest, tree: Holy, tier: 2, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_blessedrecovery.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Struck by a melee or ranged critical hit, the Priest heals 25%
            // of the damage it took over 6s, in 2s ticks (Classic 27816; TBC
            // 27813's heal over time: period 2000ms, Magic). Its heal over
            // time lands with no visual of its own until AS-352 (scoped by
            // AS-335).
            per_rank: [
                Proc((
                    trigger: CritTaken,
                    chance: Chance(1.0),
                    ranks_add: Effect,
                    effect: HealBack(fraction: 0.25, duration: 6.0, tick_interval: 2.0),
                )),
            ],
        ),
        HolyNova: (
            name: "Holy Nova",
            class: Priest, tree: Holy, tier: 3, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_holynova.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // 13-15 Holy damage to every enemy and 25-29 healing to every
            // teammate within 10 yards, each plus 16.1% of spell power,
            // instant; 50 mana.
            per_rank: [Grant(HolyNova)],
        ),
        HolyConcentration: (
            name: "Holy Concentration",
            class: Priest, tree: Holy, tier: 3, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_fanaticism.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            // +35% mana regeneration, always on, gear included. TBC has no
            // deep mana talent for Holy; the name is Wrath's. Its price is
            // computed at the reference Priest.
            per_rank: [StatPercent(ManaRegen, 0.35)],
        ),
        GuardianSpirit: (
            name: "Guardian Spirit",
            class: Priest, tree: Holy, tier: 4, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_holy_guardianspirit.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(22.0),
            requires: Some((HolyConcentration, 1)),
            // An ally receives 40% more healing for 10s; the first blow that
            // would kill it then is prevented and heals it for 30% of its
            // maximum health instead, ending the spirit. 60s, so once a match.
            per_rank: [Grant(GuardianSpirit)],
        ),

        // ---- Priest: Shadow (the talents proposal §5.2) ----
        ImprovedMindBlast: (
            name: "Improved Mind Blast",
            class: Priest, tree: Shadow, tier: 1, column: 0,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_unholyfrenzy.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Classic 15312: -1s a rank, 8 -> 7 -> 6.
            per_rank: [Patch(on: Ability(MindBlast), field: Cooldown, op: Add(-1.0))],
        ),
        ImprovedPsychicScream: (
            name: "Improved Psychic Scream",
            class: Priest, tree: Shadow, tier: 1, column: 2,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_psychicscream.jpg",
            max_rank: 2,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Classic 15448's per-rank value: -2s a rank, 30 -> 28 -> 26.
            per_rank: [Patch(on: Ability(PsychicScream), field: Cooldown, op: Add(-2.0))],
        ),
        Shadowform: (
            name: "Shadowform",
            class: Priest, tree: Shadow, tier: 2, column: 1,
            icon: "icons/talents/spell_shadow_shadowform.jpg",
            max_rank: 1,
            budget: Some(11.0),
            // Adds Shadowform to the Priest's Form choice (the proposal §1): a
            // role, chosen in Prepare and held the whole match. The form is
            // the Shadowform spell, which the Priest takes before the gates;
            // the choice rules below lock it without the form, and lock the
            // heals with it.
            per_rank: [WidenChoice(PriestForm(Shadowform)), Grant(Shadowform)],
        ),
    },

    // Choices that are exclusive (talent_choices.rs).
    choice_rules: [
        // A sacrificed Felhunter cannot carry the link: Sacrifice switches
        // Soul Link off for the match.
        SwitchesOff(option: WarlockDemon(Sacrifice), talent: SoulLink),
        // Shadowform: no healing spells. TBC's client (2.5.6.69795,
        // SpellShapeshift) excludes form 28 from Flash Heal, Holy Nova and
        // every other heal, and lists Power Word: Shield, Power Word:
        // Fortitude, Dispel Magic, Mind Blast, Mana Burn, Psychic Scream,
        // Shadow Word: Pain and Silence as castable in it.
        Forbids(option: PriestForm(Shadowform), ability: FlashHeal),
        Forbids(option: PriestForm(Shadowform), ability: HolyNova),
        // The form is the spell: castable only with the form chosen. Silence
        // (AS-416) takes the same rule: Requires(ability: Silence, option:
        // PriestForm(Shadowform)).
        Requires(ability: Shadowform, option: PriestForm(Shadowform)),
    ],

    // Each class's reference combatant at mid-run, which prices its computed
    // nodes: the starting kit with three Gauntlet picks in place, named here as
    // the sockets they fill. Until the Gauntlet's reward tables exist (G2),
    // the picks are the class's tier-1 items for the three slots offered most
    // (head, chest, legs: the 1.0 group).
    reference: {
        Warlock: {
            Head: ArcanistCrown,
            Chest: ArcanistRobes,
            Legs: ArcanistLeggings,
        },
        Rogue: {
            Head: DeathdealerCowl,
            Chest: DeathdealerTunic,
            Legs: DeathdealerLegs,
        },
        Paladin: {
            Head: JudgementCrown,
            Chest: JudgementBreastplate,
            Legs: JudgementLegguards,
        },
        Priest: {
            Head: ArcanistCrown,
            Chest: ArcanistRobes,
            Legs: ArcanistLeggings,
        },
    },
)
